ORDINANCE - Annexing to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, a parcel of land situated in
the north 102 feet of Tracts 323 and 324, Sunnyside Addition, 7th Filing, Laramie County, Wyoming
(located south of and adjacent to Rock Springs Street, east of and adjacent to Pierce Avenue, and
west of and adjacent to Polk Avenue) to be known as the Diamond Estates 5th Filing Annexation.
Mr. Shanor moved to approve on third and final  reading, seconded by Ms. Williams.  Motion
carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body present. (#4037)
ORDINANCE - Annexing to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, the South ½ of Tracts 105 and
106, Sunnyside Addition, Fourth Filing, Laramie County, Wyoming (located at the northeast corner
of the intersection of Monroe Avenue and Charles Street), to be known as the 4204 Charles
Annexation.  Mr. Shanor moved to approve on third and final reading, seconded by Ms. Williams.
Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the  governing body present. (#4038)
ORDINANCE - Amending various sections of the Cheyenne Unified Development Code
(UDC) as initiated from the 2014 Annual Review, to increase point values for larger evergreen trees,
deciduous trees, and shrub plantings, and reduce point values for large expanses of turf grass for all
sites throughout the City requiring landscape improvements.  Mr. Shanor moved to approve on
second reading, seconded by Ms. Williams.  Discussion topics included: Concern with reducing
landscaping requirements for commercial properties and first impression of an attractive community
by prospective businesses; incentivizing placement of larger trees which will retain beautification
and aesthetic efforts; landscaping costs to business owners; redistribution of point values, and new
construction landscaping challenges current provisions pose for unique building projects (ex: school
facilities).  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body present with the
exception of Dr. Rinne voting “no”.
ORDINANCE - Pursuant to Section 2.2.1, Zoning Map Amendments, Section 5.1.2, Zoning
Districts Established, and Section 5.1.3, Official Zoning Map, of the Unified Development Code,
changing the zoning classification from County MR Medium Density Residential to MR-2 Medium
Density Residential - Developing for the West 178’ of the North 102’ of Tract 324, Tract A (West
120’ of the North 102’ of Tract 323 and all of the North 102’ of Tract 324 except the West 178’) and
Tract B (all of the North 102’ of Tract 323 except the West 120’), Sunnyside Addition, 7th Filing,
Cheyenne, Wyoming, to be known as Diamond Estates, 5th Filing (replat in process) (located at the
southeast corner of the intersection of Rock Springs Street and Pierce Avenue) -- referred to Public
Services Committee (sponsor -- Mr. Shanor).
ORDINANCE - Annexing to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, portions of tract 245, 246, 247
and 248, Sunnyside Addition, 6th Filing, Laramie County, Wyoming (located at the northwest corner
of the intersection of Hayes Avenue and US Highway 30) -- referred to Public Services Committee
(sponsor -- Mr. Shanor).
RESOLUTION - Authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for US 30
